---
kind: scene
id: kai.date
title: Kai — the fifth bar
on: slotStart
when: "run.route == 'kai' && run.day == 7 && run.slot == 'afterSchool'"
priority: 10
after: 'visited("common.festival")'
---

## The old music room

::bg{location="musicRoom" time="dusk"}
::music{action="start" mood="romantic" volume="down"}
::auto{character="kai" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
@kai{emotion="smirk"}: Mind the floor. Left of the piano is a hole. Right of the piano is a bigger hole.
@kai: Four bars. I've had four bars for a year. Sit. Play the fifth one.
@kai{emotion="happy" when="holds('locked', ['ren'])"}: Aoki still thinks the room is empty. You lied very well for someone who's bad at lying.

::date{with="kai" spot="musicRoom" resultKey="duet"}

<match on="scene.date.duet.mood">
  <when is="perfect">
    @kai{emotion="fond"}: ...That's it. That's the fifth bar. Play it again, I need to hear it's real.
    ::use{component="cg" id="cgKaiDuet"}
    ::set{run.aff.kai += 2}
  </when>
  <when is="sweet">
    @kai{emotion="smirk"}: Wrong notes. Right idea. Come back tomorrow.
    ::set{run.aff.kai += 1}
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @kai{emotion="angry"}: Forget it. It's not your song. It's not anybody's.
  </otherwise>
</match>
@narrator{when="scene.date.duet.hearts >= 5"}: He leaves the lid open when you go. He never leaves the lid open.
